                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I'm going through my entire library and putting a minimum of an hour into each game and then reviewing them, here is mine for Bomb Defence:\n\nIt would take far too long to list everything wrong with this game.  So I am going to instead write out what they did correctly. \n\n1: There is a cat.\n\nThis is the most lazy and shoddy attempt at game development I have ever seen. If I ever get a chance to meet the developer I want to find a way to rub his nose in the game like a dog who just shit on the carpet. My rage is palpable right now.  Not at the game but the person who made this and thought \"Yeah, this is a good game, I'll sell this. What is a reasonable price for this pos?  I know! $8.00.\"  I've played more well executed indie games for free on sites like gamejolt.  Do not.  I repeat DO NOT give this developer any money even ironically.  I really don't want this to become the next bad rats.",
